tank will vary depending on usage. | ​ | Firewood bundles are available for sale at the office, during office hours for $10 per bundle (please note: bundles are not available during fire bans). | ​ | Garbage and Recycling Garbage bins (big black round bins) and Bottle/Can only Recycle bins (white wooden bins) are locat"], "via": "Campground Rules"}, {"url": "https://www.willowbendcampground.com/rates", "lines": [" environment, Willowbend offers a range of camping options including tenting, RV sites, pull through sites, seasonal camping packages, and charming cabin and RV rentals. | Campground map Rates | RV Campsites & Tenting | $48/night – Full Service 30 Amp RV Site (includes 30 amp power, water, and sewer) | $58/night – Full Service 50 Amp RV Site (includes 50 amp power, water, and sewer) | $25/night – Tenting (includes 1 ", ". | Campground map Rates | RV Campsites & Tenting | $48/night – Full Service 30 Amp RV Site (includes 30 amp power, water, and sewer) | $58/night – Full Service 50 Amp RV Site (includes 50 amp power, water, and sewer) | $25/night – Tenting (includes 1 person) + $5 per each additional person (ex – 4 people would cost $40/night) | Check in time 2-4pm | Early check in $15 extra | | $25 cancellation fee per site if cance", "Full Service 50 Amp RV Site (includes 50 amp power, water, and sewer) | $25/night – Tenting (includes 1 person) + $5 per each additional person (ex – 4 people would cost $40/night) | Check in time 2-4pm | Early check in $15 extra | | $25 cancellation fee per site if cancelled within a week of arrival date | | Comfort Cabins & Rental RV’s | Starting at | $155/night plus taxes, extra people– Cozy Cabin, Rustic Cabin, D", " person (ex – 4 people would cost $40/night) | Check in time 2-4pm | Early check in $15 extra | | $25 cancellation fee per site if cancelled within a week of arrival date | | Comfort Cabins & Rental RV’s | Starting at | $155/night plus taxes, extra people– Cozy Cabin, Rustic Cabin, Deluxe RV, Bunk RV | ​ | Group Bookings & Camp Kitchen Rentals | Please call for group bookings and kitchen rentals (306) 662-3006 | Cont"], "via": "Campsites & Rates"}, {"url": "https://d59aaf66-aea6-4537-aa57-c7fe15aff89d.filesusr.com/ugd/1b8490_49693882228c420eb7dd7475686f8c82.pdf", "pdf": true, "via": "Campground map"}, {"url": "https://www.willowbendcampground.com/reservation", "lines": ["mp service 50 amp serivce Pull-thru site, if available Credit Card Number (This is to secure your reservation and will not be charged until check-in. If you do not provide proper cancellation notice, you will be charged $10) Exp. Date CVC: Submit Request Thank you for your camping reservation request. We look forward to hosting you! | Contact us | | © 2023 Willowbend Campground | Maple Creek, Saskatchewan, Canada | ("], "via": "Reserve a spot"}]}
{"id": 9559, "name": "Silver Creek Plunge", "read": "2026-10-15", "pages": [{"url": "https://www.silvercreekplunge.com/", "lines": [" Reservations needed to enjoy our pool! We look forward to seeing you here! | NOTE: the pool is closed every Wednesday until after 6pm for cleaning. | Pool pricing | Children 24 months and under: free | | Children 2–12: $12 per day | | Adults 13–59: $15 per day | | Seniors 60+: $12 per day | | Evening Swim (2 hours before close): $10 | | 3-Day Pass (minimum 3 day swim required; per day cost becomes: Adults: $10; Chil", "der: free | | Children 2–12: $12 per day | | Adults 13–59: $15 per day | | Seniors 60+: $12 per day | | Evening Swim (2 hours before close): $10 | | 3-Day Pass (minimum 3 day swim required; per day cost becomes: Adults: $10; Children & Seniors: $8) | | | The original mine shaft entrance in our pool | A typical Silver Creek Plunge Saturday Night in the summer. | | Stay. | We are now taking reservations for our 2026 Se", "e A-frames sleep 4 and come equipped with either two full-beds or a full-bed and a full-futon , gas oven and stove, cold running water, and its own outdoor fire-pit, picnic table and access to a common outhouse. | Cost: $99 per night | | Family Cabins | We have 6 Family cabins which were originally the Darling Motel in Caldwell but were purchased and transported to Silver Creek Plunge in the 1980’s! These cabins are ", "leeper sofa in the front room. Each cabin also comes equipped with a propane oven and stove, cold running water, refrigerator, propane heater, and an outdoor fire-pit, picnic table, and its own private outhouse. | Cost: $139 per night | | Deluxe Family Units | We have 3 Deluxe Units. 1 is our Founder’s Cabin (Cabin 7) and the other 2 are located above our Store. Each Unit can potentially sleep 8. | Cabin 7 has 2 full", "a twin mattress located in the closet. | Each Deluxe Unit has an indoor toilet, hot-and-cold running water, propane oven and stove, a refrigerator, and a propane heater, along with their own designated fire-pit. | Cost: $169 per night | | Tent/RV Spots | Our Tent/RV sites are first-come-first-served and are currently unmarked. You will know it’s a tent site by looking for a fire-pit/picnic table combination. Come, st", " are first-come-first-served and are currently unmarked. You will know it’s a tent site by looking for a fire-pit/picnic table combination. Come, stake your spot, check-in at the office and you’ll be good to go! | Cost: $15 per night | | | We also are Camp Hosts for Boise National Forest’s Silver Creek Campground . This campground sits on the west side of Silver Creek and has 53 campsites and 2 group sites. These are", "ed at all times. (And PLEASE pick-up after your pet too) | 3) Campfires must not be left unattended at any time. All campfires must be fully extinguished before departing (please “drown your campfires”); there will be a $200 fine for campfires left hot, smoldering, or burning. | 4) Fire pits are for your camping experience so please DO NOT place, burn, or leave trash in your fire pit. Any trash left or burned will re", "will be a $200 fine for campfires left hot, smoldering, or burning. | 4) Fire pits are for your camping experience so please DO NOT place, burn, or leave trash in your fire pit. Any trash left or burned will result in a $50 fine. | 5) There is NO garbage service available. You must pack garbage out with you. (Again, any trash left will result in a $50 fine.) | 6) NO SHOOTING of any type of weapon is allowed in the ca", "T place, burn, or leave trash in your fire pit. Any trash left or burned will result in a $50 fine. | 5) There is NO garbage service available. You must pack garbage out with you. (Again, any trash left will result in a $50 fine.) | 6) NO SHOOTING of any type of weapon is allowed in the campground. | 7) Chainsaws are NOT to be run in the campgrounds for any reason. | 8) Speed Limit is 5mph for ALL vehicles throughout", "e all potable. | Even though our pool water is clean and clear, please do not drink the pool water. | | Is there a place to put our trash? | Nope. Please carry out everything you’ve carried in. There will be a charge of $50 per bag if garbage is left at your campsite or cabin. | | Contact us. | silvercreekplunge@icloud.com | | (208) 739-3400 | Facebook | @silvercreekplunge |"]}]}
